              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Loretta"
            },
            "reviewBody": "YUMMY!! Has a great flavor and very easy to make. I did not use the bacon and instead used EEVO to stir fry the veggies in. I also omitted the artichoke hearts simply because I did not have them on hand. Even without those items it was still very good. My husband really enjoyed it!"
