            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Colleen Gotling"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I needed a good text for all the leftover veggies I had from my veggie tray for the 4th of July BBQ. I didn’t have all the veggies that were called for but had most. Only missing the artichokes and mushrooms. It was still very delicious even without those. I served it with some pastina which seemed to compliment it well. Thanks for the recipe.",
